For leather cloak and regular sack there's already grease.  A greased
leather clock and a greased sack act like an oilskin cloak or oilskin
sack, but every exposure to water has a chance of washing away the
grease.

Being able to use a potion of oil to grease an item would be a nice
added function.  Other uses of oil aren't that beneficial.

I'd really like to be able to use oil to remove one level of damage from
an item.


